{
  "slug": "grasp",
  "name": "Grasp",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Deal-work workflows powered by Grasp company lookup, table creation, import, buyer, transaction, table enrichment, contact, and market research tools.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `company-lookup` (Use when the current task is to resolve, validate, or analyze one specific company in Grasp: understanding a…), `creating-tables` (Use when the user wants to find, build, generate, source, map, or import a long list/source universe of…), `finding-contacts` (Use when the user explicitly asks for person-level outreach contacts for a selected set of Grasp companies or…), `screening-and-shortlisting` (Screens and shortlists Grasp tables/universes into qualified, prioritized, ranked, or top-N outputs across companies, buyers, targets, peers, competitors,…), `table-enrichment` (Use when the user wants to add, populate, enrich, fill, estimate, compute, classify, segment, or evaluate data on…), `working-with-tables` (Use when the user wants to inspect, search, filter, keep/remove/exclude rows, sort, query, describe coverage, read rows, export,…)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `grasp`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install grasp@knowledge-work-plugins` from `grasp-ai/grasp-mcp-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
